  "limits": [
    "Whole-ticket service; station metadata does not establish item-level preparation or kitchen hardware",
    "Frozen backend IDR menu estimates and ingredient recipe quantities; no tax, invoice, payment/refund or customer signature",
    "Stock hold expiry does not free physical tables; operator cancels expired tickets and opens a new one",
    "Post-preparation cancellation records waste and retains consumed ingredients; no raw-material restock",
    "No modifiers, additional courses, item cancellation, split bills, offline POS or public self-order",
    "Current independent food/commerce grants required; assigned scope restricts ticket ownership",
    "Private read tools; no restaurant natural-language router or machine mutation authority",
    "Pending browser recovery is in memory; ingredient selector is bounded to 1000 catalog items, with API for larger catalogs",
    "All forty full operating kits and remaining general/specialist requirements remain outstanding",
    "Separate realtime template retains thirteen moderate advisories and independent SDK/live/production gates"
  ],
